  "description": "An Easier Way To See Positions and Screened Stocks",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday! We are seeing a lot of green pre-market, which is generally a good sign. Dont be surprised for some early morning chop…but overall, we are seeing a decent recovery. The S&amp;P 500 is approaching all time highs again. Woo hoo! </p><p>Individual stocks are still hit or miss, and largely chopping sideways. We want to see our current positions, gain some momentum before adding to them, or picking up new positions. We do not throw money at a stagnant market…or even worse…dollar cost average! I do see great setups building into volatility contraction patterns…but we want to see some of them breaking out, upwards, first. </p><p>As mentioned previously, as much as I loved the StockTok Dashboard we built, too many new people had no idea it even existed. Thus, I figured out how to integrate current positions and pre-screened stocks into Substack. Those are down below! I will update a fresh “StockTok Summary” post weekly….and the individual positions and screened stocks SHOULD update within the post automatically (fingers crossed, I have to test that). If they do not, I will update them manually myself. </p><p>If you are new, feel free to DM me if you want to try out the StockTok substack for a week free, or if you have any questions. I like to keep a small community, but did recently have a few spots open. Yes, I do limit how many people can join. I talk about it in this <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/free-week-with-stocktok?r=4z8lgl\">post</a>.</p><p>Have a great weekend and thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><h4>👇 Stock Positions and Screener Below 👇</h4>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
